| case | target | returned components | scored batches | removed edges |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| Two triangles and bridge | 2 | 2 | 1 | 1 |
| Four-cycle, equal maxima | 2 | 4 | 1 | 4 |
