Bridge and diamond calculations explain the shortest-path fractions. The cycle
states the batch policy’s target overshoot, and the verified karate graph shows a
complete trajectory with original-edge modularity. None of these partitions is
a universal or statistical certificate of community truth. Native actual work,
conservative numeric flags and complete-record controls make the implementation’s
costs and finite-arithmetic limits visible alongside its useful results.
